## 🏗️ Phase 2 아키텍처

### Multi-Node Cluster (3-5 노드)
```
┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐
│  Node 0      │    │  Node 1      │    │  Node 2      │
│  (Leader)    │◄───┤  (Replica)   │◄───┤  (Replica)   │
│  Primary PM  │    │  Secondary   │    │  Secondary   │
└──────────────┘    └──────────────┘    └──────────────┘
      │                    │                    │
      └────────┬───────────┴────────┬───────────┘
               │                    │
        Green Consensus (Raft)
        Power History Sync
        Load Balancing
```

### 데이터 흐름
```
Per Node:
L1 PowerSensor ──→ L2 DVFSController ──→ L3 EnergyPredictor
     ↓                    ↓                      ↓
  Power reading    Frequency scale         Forecast 1hr
  (모두 L1)         (조정 L2)                  (L3)
     │                    │                      │
     └────────┬───────────┴──────────┬───────────┘
              │                      │
        L4 GreenRaftNode (합의)
        L5 EnergyPatternDB (학습)

Cluster-wide:
ClusterMetrics ← (Power readings × 3-5) → GlobalOptimization
```

